    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/releases/tag/v15.0.1"&gt;v15.0.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removing public signing; fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3200415735" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545"&gt;#4545&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3220562841" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4552" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4552/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4552"&gt;#4552&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adding back missing overloads and reverting registering behavior by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3221117207" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4554" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4554/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4554"&gt;#4554&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/compare/v15.0.0...v15.0.1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v15.0.0...v15.0.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release supersedes the 15.0.0 release, reverting behavior and overloads so that the &lt;code&gt;AddAutoMapper&lt;/code&gt; overloads separate the "scanning for maps" from the "scanning for dependencies". Unfortunately it's not really possible to combine these two together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This also fixes a critical bug in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3200415735" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4545"&gt;#4545&lt;/a&gt; that does not work with .NET 4.x applications (as intended).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of this, the 15.0.0 will be delisted because of the breaking changes there.&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
